description: React UI layer conventions for AlmostDoneStudio
globs: src/components/**/*.{tsx,ts},src/hooks/**/*.{tsx,ts}
alwaysApply: false
---

# React

- Functional components only, no classes
- No inline styles — CSS modules or Tailwind
- No Phaser imports inside React files. Ever.
- useEffect must return cleanup when subscribing to EventBus
- Mutate Zustand only via store actions
